{"unit_id":"S1n7T__dsh-everything#card-zh","repo":"S1n7T/dsh-everything","commit":"393596da0316d8ea720b50d224d9c1e56b56575f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-everything 是面向 Windows 的 DSH 文件搜索插件，通过 Everything 本机索引注册 everything_search 工具。它优先使用本机 HTTP JSON 服务，并以官方 es.exe 命令行作为后备通道。用户可按查询表达式搜索文件名和路径，限定目录、文件或文件夹，使用正则、排序和分页，并查看结果数量及文件属性。插件可自动准备和启动 Everything 与 ES CLI，适合需要让 DSH agent 查找本机项目文件的 Windows 用户；无需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:561","index.js:921","setup.js:483"]}
{"unit_id":"S1n7T__dsh-everything#card-en","repo":"S1n7T/dsh-everything","commit":"393596da0316d8ea720b50d224d9c1e56b56575f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-everything lets Windows DSH agents search local file names and paths through the Everything index. The everything_search tool supports filters, regex, sorting, pagination, and counts. It uses the local HTTP service with es.exe fallback and can install the backend.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:561","index.js:921","setup.js:483"]}
